t(27, 85, """An experience I will not withhold; perhaps it will save a person. But on condition that it is not taken as a door to running after satanic treatments in search of ways out that go against the Book and the Sunnah.

First, I do not believe in something called the difference of curricula for a student when he moves from one country to another, so that the student or his family attribute the cause of his failure to the change of curricula. One with weak abilities is weak even if he studies a curriculum that people classify — I do not agree, but figuratively I will say "people classify" — as an easy curriculum; he will remain one with weak abilities.

The mind was created with abilities, and weak, medium and high mental abilities are all unaffected by the type of curriculum. We are talking about Arab school curricula whose content is "identical", not similar, because they are all "Western", all drawn from the Western source, only presented in a different way!

This is my experience, whose understanding was completed after 47 years had passed since its beginning, and how through the experience I understood a hidden side of sorcery. But I understood it in practice after paying attention, months ago, to a sentence I heard on a brother's channel on YouTube, in which he said: Sorcery is codes, like programming. That made me recall the long experience and tie the threads together again for the first time in my life!

At the age of four, when not many images and events stick in the mind, for me something stuck in my mind that has never been erased. An old woman, a stranger to the house, and a strange request to bring my face close to her face. Yet the scene did not end here, even though it seemed so!

This was in the country of my birth. Then came the first grade of primary school, where the mind in class was 100%, maybe 101%, asleep! It received nothing! The first grade of primary ended and the pupil did not know how to tell the letter alif from the letter ba, not because the teacher was bad or a failure, not because the state's curriculum was extraordinary, and not because the book was written in hieroglyphics!

Then the second and third grades were in another country, and the pupil here was (the first), with full marks, across all the sections and classes of the second and third grade level in the school!

Here the country changed, because the codes were written to work and be active in a different country!

Then came the return to the first country, where the codes were written .. The fourth, fifth and sixth grades of primary, and the first and second grades of middle school .. A dismal failure and passing, as we say, (barely) .. Again the matter had nothing to do with the curriculum, the books or the teachers .. The failure was caused by the 100% absence of mind, intellect and concentration. Once again the mind in class is asleep! It does not perceive! It receives nothing!

Then came the move to a new country until the end of the school stage .. The pupil here was again (the first), with almost full marks, across the classes of his stages in the school, and so it was said in the educational district!

The sorcery codes did not work. The country changed.

In the country where the sorcery was made, there were two consistent experiences .. The mind in class is asleep! Response zero, and concentration below zero!

And in two countries where the sorcery and its codes were not made, the mind was very bright, very alert, very responsive, very, very, very focused.

In both experiences the family situation was the same, and the psychological life was the same. In the country of failure social life was much better and the positive effect was certain, and yet the mind was absent. In the countries of complete success and excellence social life was bad and the psychological effect negative, so there is no relation between success and psychological stability. The experience was not psychological, nor did it have a social dimension. The experience was mental and intellectual .. In the country of failure the images of school and class are almost non-existent in memory, while in the two countries of success (the two countries) the images of school and class are remembered better and more clearly.

This is an experience I will not withhold from people, because mentioning it may correct the course of life of a person who today imagines, in his school or his university, that he is a failure, while he is simply only (oppressed) .. No person whose mind is locked, whose mind is (under a spell), perceives the truth .. he does not want to understand or to see the truth, simply because the suffering of others does not concern him at all. And today I say clearly that the experience is clearer than the sun itself and than a thousand suns .. It was not the male or the female teachers, it was not the book and the presentation of the scientific material in it, and it was not the strength or weakness of the school as a school .. All of these were innocent of shortcoming and failure in their educational mission .. The truth is that the mind was asleep .. with certainty at the highest degrees of certainty .. The mind was not receiving!

“What they have made is only a magician's trick, and the magician will not succeed wherever he comes.”""")

